{"id":"steam-4532500","steam":4532500,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Atelier Karia: The Night Kingdom & the Guide of Memories","summary":"Atelier Karia tells the story of an adventurer with no memories as she faces her past. New features add to the depth of battles and alchemy. Synthesized items take on new roles during exploration, and ingredients can be eaten to gain effects.","about":"Reawaken the past, savor the present. \r\nA vast fantasy alchemy RPG of memories and discovery.\r\n\r\nA world wrapped in mystery located deep below Aladiss. What discoveries and revelations await Karia there?\r\n\r\n\nMain Features:\r\nA vast unknown world to explore.\n\r\nThis story takes place across Aladiss and the world beneath it.\r\n\n\r\n\r\n\nA new protagonist with a mysterious ability.\n\r\nKaria has the ability to eat and analyze almost anything. Her abilities, appearance, and body shape change based on what and how much she eats.\r\n\n\r\n\r\n\nA renewed game cycle.\n\r\nUse the ingredients you gather to synthesize items to use during battle and exploration, or eat the ingredients to unlock abilities and open a new path forward. Build bases across the different regions to gain bonuses.\r\n\n\r\n\r\n\nA new way to synthesize.\n\r\nSynthesis recipes contain mana pieces and lines in this game. The pieces you use and the ways you connect them will alter the properties of the items you synthesize.\r\n\n\r\n\n\r\n\r\n\nA more strategic combat system.\n\r\nParrying, countering, and more add to this game's real-time action battles. Each of the party characters has their own unique abilities.\r\n\n\r\n\r\n\nStory:\n\r\nTwo years after the alchemist Yumia uncovered the mysteries of the continent of Aladiss, a phenomenon known as the mana withering strikes the land.\r\n\r\nKaria, a member of the Aladiss Pioneering Team, has the ability to eat and analyze almost anything. She has no memories of her past, and not even she knows why she has this power. One day, she is sent to investigate a set of ruins with the researcher Servio, and the two of them find a vast undiscovered world beneath Aladiss. It's there that Karia comes in contact with alchemy.\r\n\r\nCountless mysteries await Karia and her friends beneath Aladiss, involving both ancient legends and Karia herself as she confronts her forgotten past.\r\n\n\r\n\r\nNote: Other editions containing this product exist. Be careful not to make duplicate purchases.\r\nNote: Images are from an in-production build and may differ from the final product.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532500/3b60d414a958202c18daf3d7af4d8814d70f07f4/library_capsule.jpg?t=1794279254","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532500/39221620452ae3554b46f514a5192c674ec651e3/header.jpg?t=1794279254","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532500/cc4100f8001c34b472936813304e79599dfb79eb/library_hero.jpg?t=1794279254","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532500/39221620452ae3554b46f514a5192c674ec651e3/header.jpg?t=1794279254","background":null,"screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532500/c1afd3b2ca79014890a01a83f22ad4c9181d8bb7/ss_c1afd3b2ca79014890a01a83f22ad4c9181d8bb7.600x338.jpg?t=1794279254","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532500/c1afd3b2ca79014890a01a83f22ad4c9181d8bb7/ss_c1afd3b2ca79014890a01a83f22ad4c9181d8bb7.jpg?t=1794279254"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532500/497d1a6f5066ee869d0dcab4d753d2e06dac2298/ss_497d1a6f5066ee869d0dcab4d753d2e06dac2298.600x338.jpg?t=1794279254","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532500/497d1a6f5066ee869d0dcab4d753d2e06dac2298/ss_497d1a6f5066ee869d0dcab4d753d2e06dac2298.jpg?t=1794279254"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s